le" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14052793/state.json" "file_sha256" "da9f739dfc10d723398afc82ce80c3319645e42094381b090dc46085d599a85f" "basis" 1766 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14052793/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-77220" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "9"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14052793/state.json" "file_sha256" "da9f739dfc10d723398afc82ce80c3319645e42094381b090dc46085d599a85f" "basis" 1766 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14052793/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-77220" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "6"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14052793/state.json" "file_sha256" "da9f739dfc10d723398afc82ce80c3319645e42094381b090dc46085d599a85f" "basis" 1766 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14052793/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-76914" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the arc length of the curve $r(t)=⟨2t\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t-\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t,\\,\\frac{3{t}^{2}}{2},\\,2t\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t+\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t⟩$\nfrom  $t=0$ to $t=2.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14052793/state.json" "file_sha256" "da9f739dfc10d723398afc82ce80c3319645e42094381b090dc46085d599a85f" "basis" 1766 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14052793/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-76914" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we find ${r}^{′}(t)$ and $‖{r}^{′}(t)‖:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2t\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t-\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\frac{3{t}^{2}}{2}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2t\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t+\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-4t\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t,\\,3t,\\,4t\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t⟩ \\\\ ‖{r}^{′}(t)‖ & =\\sqrt{{(-4t\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t)}^{2}+(3t)^{2}+{(4t\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{16{t}^{2}{sin}^{2}⁡2t+9{t}^{2}+16{t}^{2}{cos}^{2}⁡2t} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{16{t}^{2}+9{t}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{25{t}^{2}} \\\\  & =5t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that $t\\ge 0$ for $t\\in [0,2].$\n\nTherefore, the arc length of the curve is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}‖{r}^{′}(t)‖\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}5t\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={(\\frac{5{t}^{2}}{2})|}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =10.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14052793/state.json" "file_sha256" "da9f739dfc10d723398afc82ce80c3319645e42094381b090dc46085d599a85f" "basis" 1766 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14052793/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-76914" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14052793/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "709af184d805f83ffe8fcf8cf1aec878f4459116c29d8589faa971d65e2952fa" "basis" 1766 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14052793/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-76914" "field" "selection" "attribute"